#. cinematic.prologue.56bd6b  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:151
msgid "No princípio havia o Um. Dele emanaram os Éons, aos pares,\ncomo luz que transborda. Ali nada dormia. Nada esquecia."
msgstr "In the beginning there was the One. From it the Aeons emanated, in pairs,\nlike overflowing light. There nothing slept. Nothing forgot."

#. cinematic.prologue.c37f5c  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:152
msgid "A mais jovem, Sophia, quis alcançar a Fonte sozinha.\nDo desejo sem par nasceu um filho sem forma,\ne ela o escondeu numa nuvem."
msgstr "The youngest, Sophia, sought to reach the Source alone.\nFrom that unpartnered desire a formless son was born,\nand she hid him in a cloud."

#. cinematic.prologue.c1bdfa  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:153
msgid "Cego para a Luz, ele se acreditou o único deus e fez o Kenoma.\nNo barro dormem as faíscas que ele levou da mãe.\n\nUma delas acaba de sentir dor."
msgstr "Blind to the Light, he believed himself the only god and made the Kenoma.\nIn the clay sleep the sparks he took from his mother.\n\nOne of them has just felt pain."

#. cinematic.epilogue.4ab9df  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:185
msgid "Todas as pedras foram lidas. A faísca lembra por inteiro."
msgstr "Every stone has been read. The spark remembers in full."

#. cinematic.epilogue.8e89d7  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:186
msgid "Ficaram %d Estelas por ler no Kenoma. As Crônicas guardam as que foram lidas."
msgstr "%d Stelae were left unread in the Kenoma. The Chronicles keep the ones that were read."

#. cinematic.epilogue.2f5ff6  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:187
msgid "CRÔNICAS  %d / %d"
msgstr "CHRONICLES  %d / %d"

#. cinematic.epilogue.863da2  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:188
msgid "GNOSIS"
msgstr "GNOSIS"

#. cinematic.epilogue.622c86  [card_cinema]
#: scripts/fx/cinematic.gd:188
msgid "João Tatarin — direção, produção e escolhas\nArte ilustrada gerada por IA sob direção do autor\nCódigo escrito com Claude (Anthropic) e Codex (OpenAI)\nSons e efeitos CC0/CC-BY — ver assets/LICENSES.md\n\nInspirado nos textos de Nag Hammadi, na Pistis Sophia\ne nos relatos de Irineu, Hipólito e Clemente."
msgstr "João Tatarin — direction, production and choices\nIllustrated art generated by AI under the author's direction\nCode written with Claude (Anthropic) and Codex (OpenAI)\nSounds and effects CC0/CC-BY — see assets/LICENSES.md\n\nInspired by the Nag Hammadi texts, the Pistis Sophia\nand the accounts of Irenaeus, Hippolytus and Clement."

